{
  "scope": "Task 10 case-to-case preparation sharing complete within one ordered engine execution and one environment. Sync-path observation, task 10 overall, task 9 remaining work and final Web acceptance remain open.",
  "contract": {
    "declaration": "prepared.imports maps a local binding alias to {case,name}; prepared.exports maps a public name to a whole binding reference. V1 migration preserves the declaration; v2 and the generated structured editor expose it.",
    "publication": "Only after producer PASS; all exports validated and copied atomically. Failed/blocked/skipped producers never publish. Missing results block consumers before hooks or environment build.",
    "isolation": "Store is local to each Engine.Run; exact environment fingerprint must match. Nested values and big integers are copied; private byte buffers, opaque handles and scrub-sensitive fields are rejected. saveKey bindings cannot be exported offline.",
    "validation": "Single case editing validates declaration and binding names; full execution preflight checks missing/forward/unknown/duplicate producers. Separate-definition execution refuses dependent cases before first dispatch and requests --suite / MCP suite=true.",
    "web": "Producer and exported-name selectors use unambiguous saved declarations. Explicit imported references and export choices remain typed; failure-only and private bindings are excluded from public export suggestions.",
    "provenance": "prepared-results.json records declaration, environment and publication/blocking status, without persisting shared values or private material."
  },
